  <meta name="twitter:card" content="https://cdn.cococe.rw/meta/cococe.png">
  <meta property="twitter:domain" content="cococe.rw">
  <meta property="twitter:url" content="https://cococe.rw">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Laptops, Printers, Accessories, Game consoles, Electronics, and much more, cococe, your wish our priority">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="COCOCE Kigali Rwanda, Laptops, Desktops, Computer accessories, Smart tv, projectors, discover what you want about digital assets near you at Kigali">

  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/components/notification.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz@14..32&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f7f9fc 0%, #eef2f7 100%);
    }

    .terms-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    }

    .list-check li {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .list-check i {
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .urgent-note {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 1rem 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #a13d0a;
      border: 1px dashed #d97c38;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .badge-term {
      background: #d0e6d9;
      color: #0e4f2e;
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 0.2rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .call-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      background: #0b2b4a;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 40px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -8px rgba(11, 43, 74, 0.4);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .call-btn:hover {
      background: #133a60;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 24px -8px rgba(11, 43, 74, 0.5);
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-6">
  <div class="terms-card max-w-7xl w-full rounded-[42px] shadow-2xl shadow-slate-400/20 p-6 md:p-10 lg:p-12 transition-all">

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-4">
      <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight flex gap-3">
        <img src="https://cdn.cococe.rw/meta/fav.png" alt="COCOCE" class="h-16">
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Terms of use.<br><span class="text-brand font-bold">You agree, we protect.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="ml-auto bg-[#d9e6f2] text-[#0b2b4a] text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#b7cde0] whitespace-nowrap">
        <i class="fas fa-file-contract mr-1"></i> Authentication Terms
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#2d4b67] border-l-4 md:border-l-5 border-[#4a7fa7] pl-4 md:pl-5 mb-8 font-normal">
      By creating an account, signing in, or using COCOCE authentication services, you are bound to the terms below. Please read carefully.
    </div>

    <div class="bg-brand-light rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border-l-6 border-brand flex items-center gap-4 shadow-sm mb-8">
      <i class="fas fa-handshake text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand"></i>
      <div class="text-slate-800">
        <strong>By using / creating / signing in</strong> to a COCOCE account, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to these authentication terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">

      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-check-double text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          Data Accuracy
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>You agree to provide <strong>accurate, current, and complete</strong> information during registration and keep it updated.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>False, misleading, or impersonating details may result in <strong>immediate account suspension</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>You are responsible for any activity that occurs under your account due to inaccurate data.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-user-shield text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          Avoid Internal Data Sharing
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>You must <strong>not share, sell, or redistribute</strong> any internal COCOCE data, credentials, or session tokens.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Sharing your login details with third parties violates these terms and compromises security.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Any unauthorized sharing may lead to <strong>permanent account termination</strong> and legal action.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-user-lock text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          Account Responsibility
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>You are solely responsible for <strong>maintaining the confidentiality</strong> of your password and session.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Notify us immediately of any <strong>unauthorized use</strong> or suspected breach of your account.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>We are not liable for losses caused by your failure to secure your credentials.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-ban text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          Prohibited Activities
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Attempting to <strong>bypass, hack, or exploit</strong> authentication mechanisms is strictly forbidden.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Using automated scripts, bots, or scrapers against the auth system is not allowed.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Any form of <strong>phishing, social engineering, or credential theft</strong> will be prosecuted.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-power-off text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          Termination
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-2">We reserve the right to <strong>suspend or terminate</strong> your account at any time if you violate these terms or pose a security risk.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-700">You may also delete your account at any time; however, certain data may be retained for legal or security purposes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-rotate text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          Changes to Terms
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-2">We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of COCOCE after changes constitutes <strong>acceptance of the new terms</strong>.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-700">Material changes will be communicated via email or a prominent notice on our platform.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#fff8ee] rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-7 border border-[#ffd8b5] shadow-md shadow-amber-200/20">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#9b4a0e] mb-5">
        <i class="fas fa-circle-exclamation text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#b55a1a]"></i>
        ⚠️ Need urgent help?
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-800 mb-4">
        If you suspect your account has been compromised, notice unauthorized activity, or need immediate assistance with authentication issues — <strong>do not wait</strong>. Call us directly.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
        <a href="/account-suspension" class="call-btn">
          Suspend My Account
        </a>
        <a href="tel:+250787195425" class="call-btn" style="background:#1d7a4b; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -8px rgba(29,122,75,0.4);">
          <i class="fas fa-phone text-lg"></i> Emergency Help line
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="urgent-note mt-5">
        <i class="fas fa-shield-virus text-2xl text-[#c9621e]"></i>
        <span>For account breaches, stolen credentials, or suspicious login alerts, call our security team immediately. Every minute matters. We are available 24/7 for urgent authentication issues.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mt-4">
        <span class="badge-term"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> 24/7 Security Response</span>
        <span class="badge-term"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Immediate Account Lock</span>
        <span class="badge-term"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Guided Recovery</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-brand flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-3 text-sm">
      <a class="flex items-center gap-1.5" href="<%=locals.protocal%><%=locals.domainName%>">
        <img src="https://cdn.cococe.rw/meta/fav.png" alt="COCOCE" class="h-8">
        <h1 class="text-brand text-lg font-extrabold">COCOCE &copy;</h1> · Your Wish Is Our Priority
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-brand"></i> sales@cococe.rw</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>